5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited for our trip! I want to go somewhere super adventurous this year! What should we check first to find the coolest place to go?,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's keep our expectations grounded, Rin. Before we start dreaming of adventures, we need to see the actual constraints. I suggest we look at the logistics first so we don't waste our time on impossible ideas.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Shunichi. We need a practical foundation before we make any decisions. To ensure the trip is sustainable and fair for everyone, we should prioritize the financial and logistical data.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm with Shunichi and Asuka. Let's not just guess. We need to know exactly how things work so we don't end up in a mess. Let's get the facts first.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. It is better to be thorough now than to deal with complications later. We should examine the data carefully to ensure the destination we choose is actually viable for all of us.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"You guys are so serious! But okay, if we need facts, I'll find the best ones! I want to know about ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus"" to see how we'll travel!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll look into ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""How last year's days ran."" I want to see exactly how much of our precious time is wasted on transit and scheduling.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately."" I want to understand the cost structures to ensure the financial burden is distributed transparently and fairly.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'll check ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" I want to know exactly how the daily schedule and the facilities are set up before we commit.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" I want to understand the balance between our collective time and individual space to avoid past issues.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, since we're both checking the ferry and train times, maybe we can compare notes! I bet we'll find a way to make the travel part of the adventure! Does anyone else have a secret spot in mind?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, calling a long commute an ""adventure"" is a classic way to ignore the boredom. I'll compare notes, but I'm looking for efficiency, not excitement. As for spots, it's too early to speculate without the data.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, it is premature to suggest specific locations. We must first analyze the cost structures and logistical constraints to avoid any financial ambiguity. I believe a clear understanding of the pricing is the only way to ensure fairness.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I get the money part, but the actual living conditions matter just as much. If the place is a dump or the schedule is too tight, the cost doesn't even matter. We need a place that actually works.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, you make a valid point. The physical environment and the daily rhythm significantly impact the quality of the experience. I believe the data on room arrangements will reveal whether a place is truly suitable for our group.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm so glad we're all thinking about different things! I'll stick with my travel research and find the fastest way to get to the fun! Let's all go find our clues and meet back here soon! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be focusing on the time-sink of the journey. Let's hope the data reveals a way to actually enjoy the trip rather than just surviving the commute. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the financial data. It is essential that we establish a clear and transparent cost structure from the start to prevent any individual from bearing an unfair burden. I will see you all soon.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm going to find out if the facilities are actually usable. I won't let us pick a place that's a total nightmare to live in. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with my research. I intend to analyze the relationship between our shared activities and the availability of personal space to ensure a balanced experience for everyone. I will see you all soon.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
